          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a silent review about ocean life.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with LED tube accents in two contrasting hues placed in depth and grade to a Portra-style palette with creamy skin tones and soft greens.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
